[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.75, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "向上，或者像所有那些东西一样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14046.389, "timestamp": "03:54:06", "text": "那。还有很多东西我还没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14049.429, "timestamp": "03:54:09", "text": "去体验。正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14052.229, "timestamp": "03:54:12", "text": "但没关系。我来这里是为了拍拍每个人的肩膀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14055.75, "timestamp": "03:54:15", "text": "不过你可以养宠物。每个人都得到一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14058.469, "timestamp": "03:54:18", "text": "拍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14060.95, "timestamp": "03:54:20", "text": "是的。希伯来书让屏幕充满"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14063.75, "timestamp": "03:54:23", "text": "很多肝病和新病。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14068.79, "timestamp": "03:54:28", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14070.63, "timestamp": "03:54:30", "text": "如果除了乔克以外还有人来，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14072.71, "timestamp": "03:54:32", "text": "就像哈利·波特说的那样，“你竟敢……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14076.07, "timestamp": "03:54:36", "text": "你站在他学习的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14078.229, "timestamp": "03:54:38", "text": "一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14081.269, "timestamp": "03:54:41", "text": "像那样飞行？你想让我飞吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14083.11, "timestamp": "03:54:43", "text": "飞行。等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14084.55, "timestamp": "03:54:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14099.99, "timestamp": "03:54:59", "text": "我的天啊。"}]